--- code
export enum SettlementOutcome {
  Settled = 'SETTLED',
  RefusedByLedger = 'REFUSED_BY_LEDGER',
  RefusedByClearing = 'REFUSED_BY_CLEARING',
}
--- facts
The audit dataset groups the results of each posting cell by the value of this enum that opens the cell's refusal message.
